<title>USA: Callaway sets $60 mln stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Callaway sets $60 mln stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Callaway Golf Co on Wednesday said its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to $60 million worth of the company's common stock in the open market or through private transactions.</p>
<p>In a statement, Callaway said since March 21, 1997 it has repurchased 1,021,543 of its common shares at a total cost of $30.0 million, or an an average cost per share of $29.37.</p>
<p>Callaway shares were up 1/8 at 27-3/4 by mid-morning.</p>
</text>
